@sheet Data [markdown]
| name | score | bonus |
| ---- | ----: | ----: |
| Ana | 7 | 1 |
| Luis | 6 | 2 |
| Sara | 5 | 3 |
| Pedro | 6 | 1 |

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
| Score total | =SUM(Data!score) |
| Top score | =MAX(Data!score) |
| With bonus | =SUM(Data!score)+SUM(Data!bonus) |

@sheet Awards
@header | Metric | Value |
| Winner line | =Summary!B3 |
| Bonus line | =Summary!B4-Summary!B2 |
